  |<#FCE7F3> Security | TLS above TCP; SSL is the historical name |
  |<#EDE9FE> Transport | TCP; sockets are a local API boundary |
  |<#FFEDD5> Network | IP addressing and router forwarding |
  |<#DCFCE7> Link | Ethernet / Wi-Fi framing and local delivery |
  |<#FEF3C7> Physical | Electrical, optical, or radio signals |
